<title>UK: Key stock and currency market movements, July 29.</title>
<headline>Key stock and currency market movements, July 29.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table shows the latest close of key indices* on major world stock exchanges, the day's change in points and the indices' 1997 closing highs and lows (with dates). Also shown are the London closing values of the German mark, the Japanese yen, the British pound and gold billion (previous day's closes in brackets):</p>
<p>		  JULY 29   DAY'S CHANGE   1997 HIGH    1997 LOW</p>
<p>		  CLOSE	IN POINTS</p>
<p> NEW YORK    8,141.31     +20.51	  8,121.11     6,391.69</p>
<p>		 (midday)			 (Jul 28)     (Apr 11)</p>
<p> LONDON	4,876.6	+14.0	   4,964.2	4,056.6</p>
<p>						    (Jul 16)     (Jan 10)</p>
<p> TOKYO	20,402.74    -172.52	 20,681.07    17,303.65</p>
<p>						    (Jun 16)     (Jan 10)</p>
<p> FRANKFURT   4,381.69     +10.53	  4,406.09     2,848.77</p>
<p>						    (Jul 23)     (Jan 2)</p>
<p> PARIS	 3,023.63	+1.43	  3,025.94     2,256.97</p>
<p>						    (Jul 25)     (Jan 2)</p>
<p> SYDNEY	2,731.90	+8.10	  2,745.90     2,352.20</p>
